add('presetsHelp','先用默认输入反复前进、返回，保持输入不变；观察读到 5 后两次弹出，再接到 8。更换输入只重启本轨迹，不清除下方预测。每帧是一项操作完成后的快照，无跳步。','Keep the default input fixed and step forward/back. Watch the two pops after reading 5, then its attachment to 8. Changing presets restarts only this trace, leaving the prediction below intact. Each frame is after one completed operation, with no skipped operations.')
