add('legend','#编号是从 0 开始的词元位置，不是值。当前 = 最近解析的词元；路径内 = 仍在栈中。已接入节点即使被弹出也留在树中。每行标出父节点编号与 L / R；根没有入边。窄屏可聚焦树并水平滚动。','IDs #0, #1, … are token positions, not values. Current = most recently parsed token; On path = still in the stack. Attached nodes remain in the tree after popping. Each row names its parent ID and L / R edge; the root has no incoming edge. On narrow screens, focus the tree to scroll horizontally.')
