add('simulation','这是 JavaScript 教学模拟，不执行下方 Python 提交。预设最多 7 个节点，完整保留所有操作；每帧深复制树、路径和记录，因此快照总空间为 O(n²)，不同于提交的辅助空间。','This JavaScript teaching simulation does not execute the Python submission below. Presets contain at most 7 nodes and retain every operation. Deep copies of tree, path and history use O(n²) total snapshot space, distinct from submission auxiliary space.')
add('invariant','为什么规则成立？不变量是每次接入后，path 恰好为从根到新节点的路径，槽位等于深度。起初空路径接入深度 0 的根，成立。假设上一次成立：新节点若更深，只可能比上一次深 1 层，栈顶就是父节点；若同深或更浅，先序已离开被弹出节点的子树，它们都不再是祖先。弹到长度 depth 后，恰好留下父节点及其祖先。左子树先出现，故空左边时必须接左；否则在有效输入下接右。压入新节点恢复不变量。全部词元处理完时，所有节点及其唯一父边已接好，path[0] 仍是根。','Why does the rule work? The invariant is that after every attachment, path is exactly the root-to-new-node path, with slot equal to depth. An empty path receives the depth-0 root, establishing it. Assume it held previously. A deeper next node can be only one level deeper, so the old top is its parent. At the same or a shallower depth, preorder has left the popped nodes’ subtrees; they are no longer ancestors. Popping to length depth leaves exactly the parent and its ancestors. The left subtree appears first, so an empty left side must be filled first; otherwise a valid input requires the right side. Pushing the new node restores the invariant. At the end all nodes and their unique parent edges have been built, and path[0] is still the root.')
add('p4','这一步要回答：在新输入 7-4--2---1--9 中，解析 9 后怎样接入？此前 path 的值为 [7,4,2,1]（槽位即深度，栈顶在右边）。path 是根到最近接入节点的路径；9 的两个短横线表示深度 2。保持这组输入，选出弹出的值及接入位置，再揭晓。','For the fresh input 7-4--2---1--9, how should we attach 9 after parsing it? Before that token, path values are [7,4,2,1] (slots are depths; the top is on the right). path is the root-to-last-attached-node path. The two dashes before 9 mean depth 2. Keep this input fixed, choose the popped values and attachment, then reveal.')
add('choose','选择下一步操作','Choose the next operations')
add('opt0','A · 只弹出 1；9 接为 2 的右孩子','A · Pop only 1; attach 9 as the right child of 2')
add('opt1','B · 依次弹出 1、2；9 接为 4 的右孩子','B · Pop 1, then 2; attach 9 as the right child of 4')
add('opt2','C · 弹出 1、2、4；9 接为 7 的右孩子','C · Pop 1, 2, 4; attach 9 as the right child of 7')
add('reveal','揭晓并解释','Reveal and explain')
add('correct','正确。','Correct.')
add('wrong0','A 少弹出一层：2 的深度是 2，它的孩子应在深度 3。','A pops one level too few: 2 is at depth 2, so its child would be at depth 3.')
add('wrong2','C 多弹出一层：7 在深度 0，它的孩子应在深度 1。','C pops one level too many: 7 is at depth 0, so its child would be at depth 1.')
add('answer','9 深度 2，所以接入前路径长度必须为 2。弹出 1、2 后剩 [7,4]，4 的左孩子已是 2，所以 9 在右边；接入后 path = [7,4,9]。从路径弹出 2 不会删除 4→2 或 2→1 的边。','9 has depth 2, so path must have length 2 before attachment. Pop 1 and 2 to leave [7,4]. Node 4 already has left child 2, so 9 goes on its right; afterward path = [7,4,9]. Popping 2 does not delete edges 4→2 or 2→1.')
add('p5','这一步要回答：怎样把路径规则写成官方 Python 提交？TreeNode 由评测环境提供，含 val、left、right；返回它的根对象。path 是节点对象列表，path[-1] 取末尾；pop() 移除末尾，append(node) 追加新节点。输入字符串不变，创建的新节点逐个连成树。','How does the path rule become an official Python submission? The judge supplies TreeNode with val, left and right fields; return its root object. path is a list of node objects; path[-1] reads the last element, pop() removes it, and append(node) adds the new node. The input string remains unchanged while newly created nodes are linked into a tree.')
add('mapping','代码映射：i 是从 0 开始的字符游标。第一个内层循环数短横线得到 depth；第二个读取整个十进制整数，value = value*10 + digit，例如 4→40→401。弹出循环对应模拟中的每个“弹出”帧，后面的 left/right 赋值及 append 对应“接入”帧。解析 5 时路径 [8,3,6] 长度 3 > 1，连续 pop 两次后把它接到 8.right。','Code mapping: i is a zero-based character cursor. The first inner loop counts dashes into depth; the second reads the whole decimal integer using value = value*10 + digit, for example 4→40→401. The pop loop corresponds to the simulation’s pop frames; the left/right assignment and append correspond to an attach frame. On parsing 5, path [8,3,6] has length 3 > 1, so two pops leave 8, then assign 8.right.')
add('costs','令 L 为输入字符数（包括每一条短横线），n 为节点数，h 为最长根到节点路径的节点数。字符只扫描一次；每节点压入一次、最多弹出一次，故时间 O(L+n)=O(L)，辅助空间 O(h)，另有 O(n) 返回树。不要写 O(n) 时间：1000 节点的单链会含 0+1+…+999 条短横线。数值最多 10⁹，整数运算在本题范围内视为常数。','Let L count input characters including every dash, n count nodes, and h count nodes on the longest root-to-node path. Scan characters once; each node is pushed once and popped at most once. Time is O(L+n)=O(L), auxiliary space O(h), plus O(n) for the returned tree. Calling this O(n) time loses the dashes: a 1000-node chain contains 0+1+…+999 dashes. Values are at most 10⁹, so integer operations are treated as constant cost here.')
add('boundaries','边界：单节点时路径保留根，直接返回；连续变深时不弹出；同深时先弹出旧兄弟；一次回退多层需 while 而不是 if。多位数必须完整读完；重复值用不同对象，不可按值合并。有效输入不会跳过深度或出现第三个孩子。本提交只处理官方有效输入，无额外的畸形输入修复。','Boundaries: a single node stays as the root; descending adds without popping; equal depth first pops the previous sibling; returning several levels needs while, not if. Read every digit of multi-digit values. Equal values are distinct objects and must not be merged. Valid inputs never skip a depth or give a third child. This submission handles the official valid-input contract, without repairing malformed encodings.')
